{"id":"forecast-07","section":3,"path":"bank/listening/forecast-07/audio-3.mp3","model":"small","duration":421.17,"segments":[{"start":0.0,"end":5.2,"text":"Part 3. You will hear a discussion between a student","words":[["Part",0.0,0.6],["3.",0.6,1.06],["You",2.1,2.66],["will",2.66,2.82],["hear",2.82,3.04],["a",3.04,3.24],["discussion",3.24,3.84],["between",3.84,4.52],["a",4.52,4.76],["student",4.76,5.2]]},{"start":5.2,"end":11.72,"text":"called Mike and his tutor about Mike's proposed project on oral history.","words":[["called",5.2,5.68],["Mike",5.68,6.04],["and",6.04,6.54],["his",6.54,6.74],["tutor",6.74,7.04],["about",7.04,8.06],["Mike's",8.06,8.74],["proposed",8.74,9.2],["project",9.2,9.98],["on",9.98,10.68],["oral",10.68,11.18],["history.",11.18,11.72]]},{"start":12.5,"end":56.69,"text":"First, you have some time to look at questions 21 to 25. Now, listen carefully and answer","words":[["First,",12.5,13.32],["you",14.32,14.48],["have",14.48,14.68],["some",14.68,14.92],["time",14.92,15.4],["to",15.4,15.9],["look",15.9,16.04],["at",16.04,16.18],["questions",16.18,16.52],["21",16.52,17.48],["to",17.48,17.94],["25.",17.94,18.62],["Now,",53.91,54.31],["listen",54.63,54.93],["carefully",54.93,55.47],["and",55.47,56.31],["answer",56.31,56.69]]},{"start":56.69,"end":59.21,"text":"questions 21 to 25.","words":[["questions",56.69,57.07],["21",57.07,58.05],["to",58.05,58.55],["25.",58.55,59.21]]},{"start":59.21,"end":68.29,"text":"Thanks, Mike, for dropping by. I've read the proposal for your project, which is an","words":[["Thanks,",59.21,60.41],["Mike,",63.47,63.73],["for",63.73,63.95],["dropping",63.95,64.19],["by.",64.19,64.57],["I've",65.39,65.71],["read",65.71,65.85],["the",65.85,66.03],["proposal",66.03,66.49],["for",66.49,66.73],["your",66.73,66.89],["project,",66.89,67.37],["which",67.75,68.01],["is",68.01,68.15],["an",68.15,68.29]]},{"start":68.29,"end":74.11,"text":"oral history of the local football team, particularly the time around 1983 when they","words":[["oral",68.29,68.51],["history",68.51,68.89],["of",68.89,69.17],["the",69.17,69.29],["local",69.29,69.53],["football",69.53,69.93],["team,",69.93,70.39],["particularly",70.79,71.33],["the",71.33,71.67],["time",71.67,71.99],["around",71.99,72.47],["1983",72.47,73.27],["when",73.27,73.95],["they",73.95,74.11]]},{"start":74.11,"end":79.83,"text":"won the league championship. But first, how do you define oral history?","words":[["won",74.11,74.31],["the",74.31,74.47],["league",74.47,74.71],["championship.",74.71,75.33],["But",76.17,76.79],["first,",76.79,77.21],["how",77.51,77.79],["do",77.79,77.99],["you",77.99,78.21],["define",78.21,78.69],["oral",78.69,79.29],["history?",79.29,79.83]]},{"start":80.57,"end":85.75,"text":"Well, in fact, I used the definition you gave us last year in our research methodology","words":[["Well,",80.57,80.87],["in",81.23,81.43],["fact,",81.43,81.75],["I",81.91,82.09],["used",82.09,82.35],["the",82.35,82.47],["definition",82.47,82.97],["you",82.97,83.33],["gave",83.33,83.57],["us",83.57,83.77],["last",83.77,84.11],["year",84.11,84.43],["in",84.43,84.65],["our",84.65,84.77],["research",84.77,85.17],["methodology",85.17,85.75]]},{"start":85.75,"end":92.73,"text":"class. I found the handout in my file. The definition says that oral histories are planned","words":[["class.",85.75,86.15],["I",86.89,87.11],["found",87.11,87.33],["the",87.33,87.47],["handout",87.47,87.89],["in",87.89,88.15],["my",88.15,88.31],["file.",88.31,88.77],["The",89.55,89.73],["definition",89.73,90.11],["says",90.11,90.63],["that",90.63,90.87],["oral",90.87,91.31],["histories",91.31,91.79],["are",91.79,92.41],["planned",92.41,92.73]]},{"start":92.73,"end":98.79,"text":"interviews or conversations about some aspect of the past which is considered historically","words":[["interviews",92.73,93.33],["or",93.33,93.81],["conversations",93.81,94.29],["about",94.29,95.47],["some",95.47,95.83],["aspect",95.83,96.25],["of",96.25,96.45],["the",96.45,96.55],["past",96.55,96.99],["which",96.99,97.43],["is",97.43,97.63],["considered",97.63,98.09],["historically",98.09,98.79]]},{"start":98.79,"end":104.11,"text":"or socially important. The interviews are with people who took part in whatever it's about,","words":[["or",98.79,99.15],["socially",99.15,99.61],["important.",99.61,100.17],["The",101.11,101.33],["interviews",101.33,101.65],["are",101.65,101.89],["with",101.89,101.99],["people",101.99,102.27],["who",102.27,102.47],["took",102.47,102.71],["part",102.71,103.01],["in",103.01,103.21],["whatever",103.21,103.45],["it's",103.45,103.81],["about,",103.81,104.11]]},{"start":104.61,"end":110.35,"text":"so there'll be a record which historians can use later for all those academic articles they write.","words":[["so",104.61,104.91],["there'll",104.91,105.15],["be",105.15,105.29],["a",105.29,105.43],["record",105.43,105.75],["which",105.75,106.15],["historians",106.15,106.73],["can",106.73,107.17],["use",107.17,107.37],["later",107.37,107.81],["for",107.81,108.55],["all",108.55,108.67],["those",108.67,108.85],["academic",108.85,109.21],["articles",109.21,109.89],["they",109.89,110.13],["write.",110.13,110.35]]},{"start":110.35,"end":116.33,"text":"And although history textbooks are mostly about famous people and important events,","words":[["And",110.35,110.69],["although",110.69,112.31],["history",112.31,112.81],["textbooks",112.81,113.25],["are",113.25,113.55],["mostly",113.55,113.83],["about",113.83,114.07],["famous",114.07,114.47],["people",114.47,114.91],["and",114.91,115.43],["important",115.43,115.85],["events,",115.85,116.33]]},{"start":116.99,"end":120.61,"text":"oral history can be about ordinary people doing ordinary things.","words":[["oral",116.99,117.19],["history",117.19,117.55],["can",117.55,117.85],["be",117.85,117.97],["about",117.97,118.29],["ordinary",118.29,118.77],["people",118.77,119.19],["doing",119.19,119.59],["ordinary",119.59,120.07],["things.",120.07,120.61]]},{"start":121.29,"end":124.19,"text":"Oral history really seems to have started in the States.","words":[["Oral",121.29,121.75],["history",121.75,122.13],["really",122.13,122.63],["seems",122.63,122.95],["to",122.95,123.11],["have",123.11,123.25],["started",123.25,123.49],["in",123.49,123.71],["the",123.71,123.83],["States.",123.83,124.19]]},{"start":124.47,"end":130.85,"text":"You're right. In fact, the first modern oral history interviews were done by a historian in New York.","words":[["You're",124.47,124.81],["right.",124.81,125.09],["In",125.69,125.91],["fact,",125.91,126.17],["the",126.29,126.39],["first",126.39,126.69],["modern",126.69,127.29],["oral",127.29,127.75],["history",127.75,128.13],["interviews",128.13,128.75],["were",128.75,128.97],["done",128.97,129.19],["by",129.19,129.45],["a",129.45,129.57],["historian",129.57,130.05],["in",130.05,130.35],["New",130.35,130.53],["York.",130.53,130.85]]},{"start":131.63,"end":138.19,"text":"By that time, audio technology had improved so much that it was fairly easy to record those interviews.","words":[["By",131.63,131.95],["that",131.95,132.15],["time,",132.15,132.59],["audio",132.95,133.11],["technology",133.11,133.83],["had",133.83,134.07],["improved",134.07,134.59],["so",134.59,135.01],["much",135.01,135.39],["that",135.39,135.85],["it",135.85,135.95],["was",135.95,136.09],["fairly",136.09,136.39],["easy",136.39,136.77],["to",136.77,136.97],["record",136.97,137.37],["those",137.37,137.63],["interviews.",137.63,138.19]]},{"start":138.19,"end":142.97,"text":"I was also interested in how the internet has contributed to oral history studies.","words":[["I",138.19,138.87],["was",138.87,139.01],["also",139.01,139.27],["interested",139.27,139.71],["in",139.71,140.15],["how",140.15,140.33],["the",140.33,140.49],["internet",140.49,140.85],["has",140.85,141.13],["contributed",141.13,141.63],["to",141.63,141.95],["oral",141.95,142.23],["history",142.23,142.55],["studies.",142.55,142.97]]},{"start":143.31,"end":147.77,"text":"Yes, it means that lots of people can access the material, and that's great.","words":[["Yes,",143.31,143.59],["it",143.91,144.05],["means",144.05,144.29],["that",144.29,144.47],["lots",144.47,144.71],["of",144.71,144.97],["people",144.97,145.25],["can",145.25,145.47],["access",145.47,145.83],["the",145.83,146.05],["material,",146.05,146.63],["and",147.07,147.23],["that's",147.23,147.43],["great.",147.43,147.77]]},{"start":148.55,"end":155.09,"text":"Also, the interactive nature of the better websites means that more students get interested in oral history.","words":[["Also,",148.55,148.99],["the",149.37,149.51],["interactive",149.51,150.05],["nature",150.05,150.57],["of",150.57,150.85],["the",150.85,150.95],["better",150.95,151.15],["websites",151.15,151.71],["means",151.71,152.41],["that",152.41,152.63],["more",152.63,152.85],["students",152.85,153.33],["get",153.33,153.63],["interested",153.63,154.07],["in",154.07,154.33],["oral",154.33,154.59],["history.",154.59,155.09]]},{"start":155.61,"end":162.29,"text":"But from what I've read, the real contribution of the internet is that the recording of the interviews will be preserved forever.","words":[["But",155.61,155.83],["from",155.83,156.13],["what",156.13,156.27],["I've",156.27,156.57],["read,",156.57,156.77],["the",157.13,157.21],["real",157.21,157.59],["contribution",157.59,158.17],["of",158.17,158.63],["the",158.63,158.75],["internet",158.75,159.25],["is",159.25,159.57],["that",159.57,159.69],["the",159.69,159.79],["recording",159.79,160.17],["of",160.17,160.41],["the",160.41,160.53],["interviews",160.53,160.99],["will",160.99,161.17],["be",161.17,161.37],["preserved",161.37,161.79],["forever.",161.79,162.29]]},{"start":162.29,"end":167.49,"text":"However, in the old days the tapes were just wear out and after some years you couldn't","words":[["However,",162.29,162.41],["in",162.89,163.21],["the",163.21,163.33],["old",163.33,163.53],["days",163.53,163.89],["the",163.89,164.15],["tapes",164.15,164.41],["were",164.41,164.57],["just",164.57,164.73],["wear",164.73,165.01],["out",165.01,165.39],["and",165.39,166.03],["after",166.03,166.27],["some",166.27,166.53],["years",166.53,166.99],["you",166.99,167.27],["couldn't",167.27,167.49]]},{"start":167.49,"end":168.99,"text":"really use them, but not now.","words":[["really",167.49,167.75],["use",167.75,168.07],["them,",168.07,168.31],["but",168.43,168.57],["not",168.57,168.69],["now.",168.69,168.99]]},{"start":169.27,"end":170.27,"text":"You're right, of course.","words":[["You're",169.27,169.53],["right,",169.53,169.81],["of",169.89,170.03],["course.",170.03,170.27]]},{"start":171.21,"end":174.03,"text":"Anyhow, let's move on to the subject of your project.","words":[["Anyhow,",171.21,171.63],["let's",171.91,172.19],["move",172.19,172.35],["on",172.35,172.57],["to",172.57,172.67],["the",172.67,172.77],["subject",172.77,173.23],["of",173.23,173.41],["your",173.41,173.55],["project.",173.55,174.03]]},{"start":174.63,"end":176.99,"text":"Why did you decide to study a sports team?","words":[["Why",174.63,174.93],["did",174.93,175.11],["you",175.11,175.25],["decide",175.25,175.67],["to",175.67,175.89],["study",175.89,176.17],["a",176.17,176.33],["sports",176.33,176.59],["team?",176.59,176.99]]},{"start":177.45,"end":182.63,"text":"Well actually I don't even like football very much and some of my friends think I'm crazy","words":[["Well",177.45,177.67],["actually",177.67,178.15],["I",178.15,178.45],["don't",178.45,178.75],["even",178.75,178.93],["like",178.93,179.23],["football",179.23,179.65],["very",179.65,179.91],["much",179.91,180.31],["and",180.31,180.97],["some",180.97,181.17],["of",181.17,181.31],["my",181.31,181.47],["friends",181.47,181.79],["think",181.79,182.01],["I'm",182.01,182.23],["crazy",182.23,182.63]]},{"start":182.63,"end":187.27,"text":"to go for that subject but my dad is a huge fan and he might be able to help me.","words":[["to",182.63,182.89],["go",182.89,183.03],["for",183.03,183.17],["that",183.17,183.33],["subject",183.33,183.81],["but",183.81,184.47],["my",184.47,184.65],["dad",184.65,184.93],["is",184.93,185.13],["a",185.13,185.25],["huge",185.25,185.51],["fan",185.51,185.83],["and",185.83,186.19],["he",186.19,186.29],["might",186.29,186.43],["be",186.43,186.57],["able",186.57,186.75],["to",186.75,186.89],["help",186.89,187.07],["me.",187.07,187.27]]},{"start":187.47,"end":191.19,"text":"And how did you find out background about the team?","words":[["And",187.47,187.79],["how",187.79,189.05],["did",189.05,189.19],["you",189.19,189.33],["find",189.33,189.59],["out",189.59,189.85],["background",189.85,190.29],["about",190.29,190.71],["the",190.71,190.89],["team?",190.89,191.19]]},{"start":191.19,"end":197.11,"text":"team. You talk to the team manager, I assume. Yes, I did manage to track him down. And","words":[["team.",191.19,191.35],["You",191.51,191.95],["talk",191.95,192.27],["to",192.27,192.47],["the",192.47,192.61],["team",192.61,192.83],["manager,",192.83,193.31],["I",193.51,193.63],["assume.",193.63,193.89],["Yes,",194.21,194.47],["I",194.81,194.95],["did",194.95,195.13],["manage",195.13,195.41],["to",195.41,195.63],["track",195.63,195.83],["him",195.83,196.01],["down.",196.01,196.25],["And",196.85,197.11]]},{"start":197.11,"end":202.05,"text":"I looked at all the old news stories about the team in the town newspaper office. That","words":[["I",197.11,197.23],["looked",197.23,197.37],["at",197.37,197.53],["all",197.53,197.71],["the",197.71,197.83],["old",197.83,198.01],["news",198.01,198.31],["stories",198.31,198.71],["about",198.71,198.99],["the",198.99,199.17],["team",199.17,199.47],["in",199.47,199.61],["the",199.61,199.75],["town",199.75,199.99],["newspaper",199.99,200.47],["office.",200.47,200.99],["That",201.77,202.05]]},{"start":202.05,"end":206.61,"text":"was where I got the most helpful information. I had high hopes that the local library would","words":[["was",202.05,202.17],["where",202.17,202.33],["I",202.33,202.45],["got",202.45,202.61],["the",202.61,202.77],["most",202.77,202.95],["helpful",202.95,203.33],["information.",203.33,203.85],["I",204.65,204.87],["had",204.87,204.97],["high",204.97,205.25],["hopes",205.25,205.53],["that",205.53,205.69],["the",205.69,205.77],["local",205.77,205.97],["library",205.97,206.43],["would",206.43,206.61]]},{"start":206.61,"end":210.31,"text":"have lots of stuff, but they don't keep many records for more than ten years.","words":[["have",206.61,206.75],["lots",206.75,206.91],["of",206.91,207.09],["stuff,",207.09,207.37],["but",207.93,208.21],["they",208.21,208.31],["don't",208.31,208.47],["keep",208.47,208.63],["many",208.63,208.83],["records",208.83,209.23],["for",209.23,209.43],["more",209.43,209.57],["than",209.57,209.71],["ten",209.71,209.93],["years.",209.93,210.31]]},{"start":211.07,"end":216.21,"text":"I know that you managed to locate ten of the original 18 members of the team using","words":[["I",211.07,211.41],["know",211.41,211.59],["that",211.59,211.73],["you",211.73,211.89],["managed",211.89,212.21],["to",212.21,212.43],["locate",212.43,212.67],["ten",212.67,213.13],["of",213.13,213.37],["the",213.37,213.51],["original",213.51,213.91],["18",213.91,214.47],["members",214.47,214.97],["of",214.97,215.19],["the",215.19,215.29],["team",215.29,215.65],["using",215.65,216.21]]},{"start":216.21,"end":221.61,"text":"an old-fashioned method, didn't you? Not a website or anything, just the telephone directory.","words":[["an",216.21,216.41],["old",216.41,216.63],["-fashioned",216.63,216.93],["method,",216.93,217.43],["didn't",217.61,217.85],["you?",217.85,218.05],["Not",218.49,218.77],["a",218.77,218.95],["website",218.95,219.31],["or",219.31,219.65],["anything,",219.65,219.97],["just",220.33,220.53],["the",220.53,220.75],["telephone",220.75,221.03],["directory.",221.03,221.61]]},{"start":221.83,"end":224.57,"text":"Yes, I didn't even need to use the local team's records.","words":[["Yes,",221.83,222.11],["I",222.41,222.55],["didn't",222.55,222.71],["even",222.71,222.89],["need",222.89,223.09],["to",223.09,223.27],["use",223.27,223.45],["the",223.45,223.59],["local",223.59,223.81],["team's",223.81,224.29],["records.",224.29,224.57]]},{"start":228.1,"end":234.96,"text":"Before you hear the rest of the discussion, you have some time to look at Questions 26 to 30.","words":[["Before",228.1,228.5],["you",228.5,228.8],["hear",228.8,229.02],["the",229.02,229.16],["rest",229.16,229.44],["of",229.44,229.56],["the",229.56,229.66],["discussion,",229.66,230.14],["you",230.88,231.16],["have",231.16,231.34],["some",231.34,231.54],["time",231.54,231.96],["to",231.96,232.4],["look",232.4,232.52],["at",232.52,232.7],["Questions",232.7,233.0],["26",233.0,234.02],["to",234.02,234.48],["30.",234.48,234.96]]},{"start":260.15,"end":265.01,"text":"Now listen and answer Questions 26 to 30.","words":[["Now",260.15,260.57],["listen",260.57,260.93],["and",260.93,261.83],["answer",261.83,262.45],["Questions",262.45,263.17],["26",263.17,264.23],["to",264.23,264.59],["30.",264.59,265.01]]},{"start":268.39,"end":275.07,"text":"OK, now I've read your proposal carefully. Overall, your plan seemed excellent. But","words":[["OK,",268.39,268.85],["now",269.39,269.61],["I've",269.61,269.95],["read",269.95,270.13],["your",270.13,270.31],["proposal",270.31,270.77],["carefully.",270.77,271.23],["Overall,",272.07,272.67],["your",272.95,273.13],["plan",273.13,273.47],["seemed",273.47,273.79],["excellent.",273.79,274.31],["But",274.77,275.07]]},{"start":275.07,"end":277.05,"text":"And I want to discuss how you might improve them.","words":[["And",275.07,275.11],["I",275.11,275.23],["want",275.23,275.39],["to",275.39,275.49],["discuss",275.49,275.75],["how",275.75,276.07],["you",276.07,276.23],["might",276.23,276.39],["improve",276.39,276.77],["them.",276.77,277.05]]},{"start":277.35,"end":277.63,"text":"Great!","words":[["Great!",277.35,277.63]]},{"start":278.19,"end":280.27,"text":"I've read through the list of questions you've drafted.","words":[["I've",278.19,278.29],["read",278.29,278.41],["through",278.41,278.65],["the",278.65,278.81],["list",278.81,278.99],["of",278.99,279.13],["questions",279.13,279.49],["you've",279.49,279.91],["drafted.",279.91,280.27]]},{"start":281.23,"end":286.01,"text":"I felt most of them are rather complex to be processed as oral questions.","words":[["I",281.23,281.45],["felt",281.45,281.83],["most",281.83,282.41],["of",282.41,282.65],["them",282.65,282.87],["are",282.87,283.03],["rather",283.03,283.31],["complex",283.31,283.87],["to",283.87,284.25],["be",284.25,284.41],["processed",284.41,284.79],["as",284.79,285.09],["oral",285.09,285.41],["questions.",285.41,286.01]]},{"start":286.67,"end":290.99,"text":"You don't have too many, which is good, but you should try to do something about that","words":[["You",286.67,286.89],["don't",286.89,287.13],["have",287.13,287.27],["too",287.27,287.47],["many,",287.47,287.79],["which",287.93,288.07],["is",288.07,288.21],["good,",288.21,288.49],["but",288.95,289.27],["you",289.27,289.47],["should",289.47,289.65],["try",289.65,289.89],["to",289.89,290.03],["do",290.03,290.15],["something",290.15,290.49],["about",290.49,290.75],["that",290.75,290.99]]},{"start":290.99,"end":291.39,"text":"problem.","words":[["problem.",290.99,291.39]]},{"start":291.73,"end":292.01,"text":"Right.","words":[["Right.",291.73,292.01]]},{"start":292.57,"end":293.31,"text":"I'll work on them.","words":[["I'll",292.57,292.77],["work",292.77,292.97],["on",292.97,293.15],["them.",293.15,293.31]]},{"start":293.83,"end":296.11,"text":"And the time you've allotted for each interview.","words":[["And",293.83,294.19],["the",294.19,294.35],["time",294.35,294.77],["you've",294.77,295.09],["allotted",295.09,295.35],["for",295.35,295.59],["each",295.59,295.77],["interview.",295.77,296.11]]},{"start":296.83,"end":300.35,"text":"Actually, I think you may have scheduled too much time for each.","words":[["Actually,",296.83,297.31],["I",297.63,297.81],["think",297.81,297.97],["you",297.97,298.19],["may",298.19,298.35],["have",298.35,298.49],["scheduled",298.49,298.75],["too",298.75,299.11],["much",299.11,299.43],["time",299.43,299.83],["for",299.83,300.07],["each.",300.07,300.35]]},{"start":300.87,"end":303.47,"text":"You want them to be tight, not going on and on.","words":[["You",300.87,301.17],["want",301.17,301.35],["them",301.35,301.45],["to",301.45,301.59],["be",301.59,301.71],["tight,",301.71,302.17],["not",302.43,302.61],["going",302.61,302.91],["on",302.91,303.13],["and",303.13,303.21],["on.",303.21,303.47]]},{"start":303.47,"end":305.29,"text":"That makes for better results.","words":[["That",303.47,304.07],["makes",304.07,304.37],["for",304.37,304.57],["better",304.57,304.75],["results.",304.75,305.29]]},{"start":305.95,"end":307.15,"text":"I can change the schedule.","words":[["I",305.95,306.11],["can",306.11,306.27],["change",306.27,306.63],["the",306.63,306.83],["schedule.",306.83,307.15]]},{"start":308.13,"end":309.89,"text":"One thing I'm nervous about","words":[["One",308.13,308.53],["thing",308.53,308.79],["I'm",308.79,309.19],["nervous",309.19,309.49],["about",309.49,309.89]]},{"start":309.89,"end":311.77,"text":"is the recording equipment I use.","words":[["is",309.89,310.27],["the",310.27,310.43],["recording",310.43,310.79],["equipment",310.79,311.19],["I",311.19,311.49],["use.",311.49,311.77]]},{"start":312.29,"end":313.55,"text":"I've got an old recorder.","words":[["I've",312.29,312.55],["got",312.55,312.67],["an",312.67,312.85],["old",312.85,313.09],["recorder.",313.09,313.55]]},{"start":314.33,"end":316.13,"text":"It runs without making too much noise","words":[["It",314.33,314.69],["runs",314.69,314.87],["without",314.87,315.11],["making",315.11,315.43],["too",315.43,315.61],["much",315.61,315.83],["noise",315.83,316.13]]},{"start":316.13,"end":317.21,"text":"and it isn't complicated.","words":[["and",316.13,316.29],["it",316.29,316.41],["isn't",316.41,316.65],["complicated.",316.65,317.21]]},{"start":317.77,"end":319.87,"text":"But it sometimes just doesn't seem to work.","words":[["But",317.77,318.01],["it",318.01,318.09],["sometimes",318.09,318.47],["just",318.47,318.83],["doesn't",318.83,319.15],["seem",319.15,319.39],["to",319.39,319.55],["work.",319.55,319.87]]},{"start":320.55,"end":321.69,"text":"It stopped during an interview","words":[["It",320.55,320.65],["stopped",320.65,320.93],["during",320.93,321.29],["an",321.29,321.43],["interview",321.43,321.69]]},{"start":321.69,"end":322.81,"text":"I tried out with my dad.","words":[["I",321.69,321.91],["tried",321.91,322.09],["out",322.09,322.27],["with",322.27,322.39],["my",322.39,322.53],["dad.",322.53,322.81]]},{"start":323.29,"end":325.21,"text":"The important thing is just be ready","words":[["The",323.29,323.49],["important",323.49,323.95],["thing",323.95,324.29],["is",324.29,324.55],["just",324.55,324.73],["be",324.73,324.91],["ready",324.91,325.21]]},{"start":325.21,"end":326.15,"text":"if anything happens.","words":[["if",325.21,325.45],["anything",325.45,325.67],["happens.",325.67,326.15]]},{"start":326.93,"end":328.13,"text":"I'll take some spare batteries","words":[["I'll",326.93,327.03],["take",327.03,327.21],["some",327.21,327.41],["spare",327.41,327.67],["batteries",327.67,328.13]]},{"start":328.13,"end":329.99,"text":"or even an extra recorder.","words":[["or",328.13,328.69],["even",328.69,328.95],["an",328.95,329.13],["extra",329.13,329.45],["recorder.",329.45,329.99]]},{"start":329.99,"end":334.79,"text":"Now, I'm a little concerned with the subjects you've chosen to cover.","words":[["Now,",329.99,330.21],["I'm",331.67,332.03],["a",332.03,332.11],["little",332.11,332.31],["concerned",332.31,332.91],["with",332.91,333.09],["the",333.09,333.25],["subjects",333.25,333.65],["you've",333.65,333.97],["chosen",333.97,334.31],["to",334.31,334.51],["cover.",334.51,334.79]]},{"start":335.51,"end":338.83,"text":"The topics seem quite general, not very specific.","words":[["The",335.51,335.67],["topics",335.67,335.97],["seem",335.97,336.29],["quite",336.29,336.63],["general,",336.63,337.45],["not",337.95,338.07],["very",338.07,338.31],["specific.",338.31,338.83]]},{"start":339.71,"end":342.91,"text":"For example, why did they like playing for this team?","words":[["For",339.71,339.91],["example,",339.91,340.31],["why",340.81,341.11],["did",341.11,341.31],["they",341.31,341.49],["like",341.49,341.75],["playing",341.75,342.13],["for",342.13,342.35],["this",342.35,342.53],["team?",342.53,342.91]]},{"start":343.93,"end":347.35,"text":"You need to talk about more exact things and feelings.","words":[["You",343.93,344.27],["need",344.27,344.43],["to",344.43,344.55],["talk",344.55,344.79],["about",344.79,345.07],["more",345.07,345.45],["exact",345.45,345.99],["things",345.99,346.71],["and",346.71,346.97],["feelings.",346.97,347.35]]},{"start":348.11,"end":350.17,"text":"That way your results will be more valuable.","words":[["That",348.11,348.41],["way",348.41,348.69],["your",348.69,348.91],["results",348.91,349.31],["will",349.31,349.49],["be",349.49,349.59],["more",349.59,349.77],["valuable.",349.77,350.17]]},{"start":350.63,"end":352.01,"text":"I'll try to refine them.","words":[["I'll",350.63,350.97],["try",350.97,351.21],["to",351.21,351.39],["refine",351.39,351.73],["them.",351.73,352.01]]},{"start":352.61,"end":357.07,"text":"And you know, the plan for my report seems to be just to report back more or less what","words":[["And",352.61,352.95],["you",352.95,353.41],["know,",353.41,353.53],["the",353.69,353.81],["plan",353.81,354.09],["for",354.09,354.25],["my",354.25,354.37],["report",354.37,354.67],["seems",354.67,354.99],["to",354.99,355.25],["be",355.25,355.43],["just",355.43,355.71],["to",355.71,355.89],["report",355.89,356.15],["back",356.15,356.35],["more",356.35,356.61],["or",356.61,356.73],["less",356.73,356.91],["what",356.91,357.07]]},{"start":357.07,"end":362.73,"text":"the players say, what happened, when, what they each did and so on. But I'm not sure","words":[["the",357.07,357.19],["players",357.19,357.47],["say,",357.47,357.87],["what",358.33,358.53],["happened,",358.53,358.95],["when,",359.15,359.35],["what",359.87,360.01],["they",360.01,360.15],["each",360.15,360.37],["did",360.37,360.57],["and",360.57,360.73],["so",360.73,360.95],["on.",360.95,361.21],["But",361.81,362.25],["I'm",362.25,362.37],["not",362.37,362.51],["sure",362.51,362.73]]},{"start":362.73,"end":363.25,"text":"about that.","words":[["about",362.73,362.97],["that.",362.97,363.25]]},{"start":363.63,"end":369.83,"text":"Yes. Although your outline seems long enough, change it to indicate that you plan to include","words":[["Yes.",363.63,363.99],["Although",364.55,365.01],["your",365.01,365.23],["outline",365.23,365.57],["seems",365.57,366.09],["long",366.09,366.45],["enough,",366.45,366.83],["change",367.25,367.63],["it",367.63,367.89],["to",367.89,368.09],["indicate",368.09,368.51],["that",368.51,368.79],["you",368.79,368.93],["plan",368.93,369.21],["to",369.21,369.47],["include",369.47,369.83]]},{"start":369.83,"end":375.49,"text":"your own evaluation of the data you get from your interviewees. Anyhow, best of luck on","words":[["your",369.83,370.11],["own",370.11,370.31],["evaluation",370.31,370.77],["of",370.77,371.23],["the",371.23,371.35],["data",371.35,371.67],["you",371.67,371.89],["get",371.89,372.15],["from",372.15,372.39],["your",372.39,372.57],["interviewees.",372.57,373.47],["Anyhow,",374.31,374.73],["best",374.81,374.91],["of",374.91,375.13],["luck",375.13,375.29],["on",375.29,375.49]]},{"start":375.49,"end":377.89,"text":"your project. I look forward to seeing the results.","words":[["your",375.49,375.61],["project.",375.61,376.01],["I",376.51,376.67],["look",376.67,376.79],["forward",376.79,377.05],["to",377.05,377.21],["seeing",377.21,377.37],["the",377.37,377.53],["results.",377.53,377.89]]},{"start":378.57,"end":379.51,"text":"Thanks for your help.","words":[["Thanks",378.57,378.91],["for",378.91,379.09],["your",379.09,379.21],["help.",379.21,379.51]]},{"start":383.45,"end":390.95,"text":"That is the end of part 3. You now have 30 seconds to check your answers to part 3.","words":[["That",383.45,384.13],["is",384.13,384.37],["the",384.37,384.53],["end",384.53,384.79],["of",384.79,384.93],["part",384.93,385.19],["3.",385.19,385.65],["You",386.57,386.91],["now",386.91,387.13],["have",387.13,387.39],["30",387.39,387.83],["seconds",387.83,388.31],["to",388.31,388.91],["check",388.91,389.29],["your",389.29,389.63],["answers",389.63,390.05],["to",390.05,390.33],["part",390.33,390.55],["3.",390.55,390.95]]}]}